...
ip6->payload_len = bpf_htons(bpf_ntohs(ip6->payload_len)
                        + ICMP6_ND_OPT_LEN);
```

In `icmp6_send_ndisc_adv`, the NA header is filled (type `ICMP6_NA_MSG_TYPE`, solicited bit set), and router/override flags depend on `to_router`:

```c
