For a service loopback target (under `USE_LOOPBACK_LB`), it uses the source MAC. For endpoints, host endpoints return `CTX_ACT_OK` (passed to stack so the NA carries the node IP), otherwise it replies with the router MAC:

```c
ep = __lookup_ip6_endpoint(&target);
